AB  - A simple numerical experiment demonstrates that the reduced major axis regression, rather than standard linear regression, is likely to be the method of choice for the regression analysis of air quality datasets. The case used for illustration is that of determining equivalence of alternative PM10 measurement systems. Copyright © 2001 .
